{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sky Realm was always a bit distanced from earthly matters, both literally and figuratively. So, when Celene and her crew land among the clouds with a diplomatic mission, they are immediately alarmed: something seems to be off there, in a very familiar yet slightly new way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The winged rats are on the move, more aggressive than ever. The greenery is withering. A proud and noble gryphon is barely breathing, beaten and bruised. Could it be that these faraway lands are already facing the same adversaries the elven scouts have already fought before?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, Celene will never let something like this slide. She's much more experienced now, but her enemy is unusually crafty this time, too. Who will prevail in this unexpected battle of wits? We're willing to bet on Celene!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Experience an exciting fantasy story set in the Sky Realm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Choose between multiple game modes: from a relaxed story-driven experience to an intense race against time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Work together with your crew members to outsmart your opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Conquer the heart of a proud and majestic gryphon!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Collector's Edition includes 15 levels continuing the main story line, more tasks and achievements, hidden puzzle pieces and coloring materials, downloadable wallpapers, and a grand art piece you can complete by acing all the levels!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2926630?t=1752847430","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2926630?t=1752847430","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926630/e041d0aa27caac07c4b42bfd933ca1af0e396877/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752847430","capsule_imagev5":